ening where eligible"},{"text":"Academic + English requirements"}],[{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"TUM, Mannheim, LMU, RWTH ecosystem"},{"text":"DAAD + university funding"},{"text":"Programme prerequisites"}],[{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Toronto, UBC, Waterloo, McGill"},{"text":"University funding"},{"text":"Programme fit"}],[{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Melbourne, UNSW, Monash, ANU"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Academic + English requirements"}],[{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Erasmus University Rotterdam, Delft, Amsterdam"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Quantitative/business requirements"}],[{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"NUS, NTU, SMU"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Academic profile"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For Product Management, do not search only for programmes titled \"Product Management.\" Relevant postgraduate areas can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Information Systems"},{"text":"Technology Management"},{"text":"Innovation"},{"text":"Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"HCI"},{"text":"Computer Science"},{"text":"Digital Transformation"},{"text":"Management Science"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful scholarship resources:"},{"type":"p","text":"USIEF / Fulbright-Nehru\nDAAD India","url":"https://www.usief.org.in/"}]},{"heading":"Going Forward","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["IPM Student","Product Intern","APM / Product Analyst / Product Associate","Product Manager","Senior Product Manager","Group Product Manager / Lead PM","Product Director","VP Product","Chief Product Officer"]},{"type":"p","text":"Alternative route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product Analyst","Data/Product Analytics","Product Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"Another:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Analyst","Product Strategy","Product Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"Another:"},{"type":"h","text":"Engineer/Technical background → Technical Product Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Product Manager Career Tracks"},{"type":"p","text":"By the end of the IPM programme, choose a primary product direction."},{"type":"h","text":"Consumer PM"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UX"},{"text":"Growth"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Consumer psychology"},{"text":"Experimentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"B2B PM"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Enterprise workflows"},{"text":"SaaS"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Customer success"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI PM"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ML fundamentals"},{"text":"LLMs"},{"text":"Evaluation"},{"text":"AI safety"},{"text":"Data"},{"text":"AI UX"}]},{"type":"h","text":"FinTech PM"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Payments"},{"text":"Lending"},{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"Risk"},{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"Financial products"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical PM"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Architecture"},{"text":"Cloud"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Developer experience"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Growth PM"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Acquisition"},{"text":"Activation"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Monetisation"},{"text":"Experimentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"PhD Directions"},{"type":"p","text":"A Product Management professional can eventually pursue research in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Information Systems"},{"text":"Management Science"},{"text":"Innovation Management"},{"text":"Technology Management"},{"text":"Human-Computer Interaction"},{"text":"Consumer Behaviour"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Artificial Intelligence"},{"text":"Human-AI Interaction"},{"text":"Decision Science"},{"text":"Operations Research"},{"text":"Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Digital Transformation"},{"text":"Product Innovation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046 Career Evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"The future Product Manager will increasingly operate as an AI-enabled business and technology leader."},{"type":"p","text":"AI will accelerate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research synthesis"},{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"Product documentation"},{"text":"Analytics"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Experimentation"},{"text":"Competitive intelligence"},{"text":"Product discovery"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But the PM's highest-value responsibilities will remain:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Choosing the right problem","Making trade-offs","Aligning teams","Taking responsibility for outcomes"]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Strategy","Customer Understanding","Technology","Data","AI","Leadership"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A senior PM should be capable of moving from:"},{"type":"h","text":"“What feature should we build?”"},{"type":"p","text":"to:"},{"type":"p","text":"“What customer and business outcome are we trying to create, and what is the highest-leverage way to achieve it?”"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong IPM graduate targeting Product Management should ideally have:"},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strategy"},{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Business models"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Product"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product discovery"},{"text":"Customer research"},{"text":"Roadmapping"},{"text":"Prioritisation"},{"text":"Product strategy"},{"text":"Product lifecycle"},{"text":"Product metrics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Cloud fundamentals"},{"text":"Software lifecycle"},{"text":"AI/ML fundamentals"},{"text":"Technical architecture awareness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"Experimentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Execution"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Agile"},{"text":"User stories"},{"text":"Requirements"},{"text":"Stakeholder management"},{"text":"Launch planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Leadership"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Emotional intelligence"},{"text":"Conflict resolution"},{"text":"Decision-making"},{"text":"Strategic thinking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"AI product design"},{"text":"LLM fundamentals"},{"text":"AI evaluation"},{"text":"AI safety and responsible deployment"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["6–8 strong product case studies","2–3 relevant internships","1 shipped product/project","1 major product capstone."],"sep":"+","label":"Portfolio target"}]}]}